guide.text:
Open tshock\config.json (in the folder you unzipped, e.g. C:\TShock\tshock\config.json) in Notepad. Inside "Settings", set "RestApiEnabled": true and keep "RestApiPort": 7878. Find "ApplicationRestTokens": {} and change it to
"ApplicationRestTokens": { "PUT-A-LONG-SECRET-HERE": { "Username": "GiftDeck", "UserGroupName": "superadmin" } }
Use your own long random text for the token and keep it secret: anyone with it can run any command on your server. Save the file. TShock only reads tokens when it starts, so restart the server after changing them.
